A chat stream that ends without a finish_reason, or with finish_reason error,
ends in a RUN_ERROR (code incomplete-stream) instead of finishing as stop or
content_filter. That RUN_ERROR, and the one the catch reports, carry the
usage the stream reported before it failed. Upstream PR to be opened; remove
when released.

